abstract: "Offline, standard-library-only demo for validating small public-information JSON bundles, importing them into local file libraries, and merging libraries carried between disconnected devices, with explicit expiry, supersession, and revision-conflict reporting. Its SHA-256 digests detect accidental changes only; they are not signatures and do not establish authenticity."
